    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as Final Boss and kill all the heroes coming to your room. Kill heroes and earn gold to buy new skills.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Place your weapons in such a way as to kill enemies before they get close to you.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Otherwise you can always teleport far away<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When the situation gets hot, a good missile can solve everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 6 Bosses to play<br></li><li> 3 different scenarios (fantasy, space e modern)<br></li><li> Every boss has a different play style<br></li><li> Endless mode to unlock<br></li><li> Tribute to '80 games</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as Final Boss and kill all the heroes coming to your room. Kill heroes and earn gold to buy new skills.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/502982005af2137b845e42d859abe029.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Place your weapons in such a way as to kill enemies before they get close to you.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/5e6b4aaaecf8c46d90dddcd23a65ee6a.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Otherwise you can always teleport far away<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.poster.avif?t=1724832612\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.webm?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049670/extras/23854ad72508a630720781b516341dd1.mp4?t=1724832612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When the situation gets hot, a good missile can solve everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 6 Bosses to play<br></li><li> 3 different scenarios (fantasy, space e modern)<br></li><li> Every boss has a different play style<br></li><li> Endless mode to unlock<br></li><li> Tribute to '80 games</li></ul>",
